<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 12:15:14 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>ActivTrak CEO：120,620 名员工揭示了 AI 成熟度</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/activtrak-ceo-what-120620-workers-reveal-about-ai-maturity/</link><description>我认识的大多数领导者都倾向于制定人工智能采用策略，就好像每个员工都应该是人工智能超级用户一样。我们的数据使这个想法变得复杂。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/heidi-farris-solid-background-q225.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 11:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/activtrak-ceo-what-120620-workers-reveal-about-ai-maturity/</guid></item><item><title>市值 270 亿美元的科技巨头惠普的高管回击 Z 世代的懒惰标签，称他们非常善于倾听和建立关系</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/hp-exec-george-brasher-hits-back-at-gen-z-lazy-label-great-at-listening-building-relationships/</link><description>乔治·布拉舍 (George Brasher) 表示，他的 Z 世代同事“与工作有着健康的关系”，并且知道如何倾听和建立信任。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/George-Brasher-Headshot-copy-e1786738325929.jpeg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 10:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/hp-exec-george-brasher-hits-back-at-gen-z-lazy-label-great-at-listening-building-relationships/</guid></item><item><title>与机器人交谈当时可能感觉很好，但越来越多的研究表明它并不能治愈孤独感</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/ai-chatbot-research-loneliness/</link><description>研究人员、心理学家和生物伦理学家一致认为：与机器人进行良好的对话并不等同于被另一个人认识&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2286500431-e1786745283360.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 10:10:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/ai-chatbot-research-loneliness/</guid></item><item><title>124 万亿美元的巨额财富转移正在全面展开，但非营利组织因如何追逐千禧一代新发现的财富而“瘫痪”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/124-trillion-great-wealth-transfer-philanthropy-millennials/</link><description>捐赠软件公司 Bloomerang 的高管史蒂夫·伊索姆 (Steve Isom) 表示，大多数非营利组织以错误的方式接触最年轻一代的捐赠者。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1410131058-e1786729688831.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 10:05:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/124-trillion-great-wealth-transfer-philanthropy-millennials/</guid></item><item><title>坎迪斯·布什内尔 (Candace Bushnell) 谈人工智能、创造力以及为什么原创性仍然获胜</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/candace-bushnell-on-ai-creativity-and-why-originality-still-wins/</link><description>《欲望都市》的创作者坎迪斯·布什内尔 (Candace Bushnell) 讲述了真实性的力量、创意声音的价值以及打造经得起时间考验的东西。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/bushnell-e1786657194591.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/candace-bushnell-on-ai-creativity-and-why-originality-still-wins/</guid></item><item><title>有意识地不发号施令不仅仅是 Z 世代的专利。我是一名首席营销官，我做到了</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/conscious-unbossing-isnt-just-a-gen-z-thing-im-a-cmo-who-did-it/</link><description>Z世代因“有意识地不发号施令”而受到赞誉。但有些悄悄离开管理层的人的资历要高得多，人工智能是其中的一个重要原因。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/juliana.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 09:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/conscious-unbossing-isnt-just-a-gen-z-thing-im-a-cmo-who-did-it/</guid></item><item><title>策略师表示，人工智能泡沫不只是一个，而是存在“一系列滚动的泡沫”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/ai-bubble-sequence-saas-software-stocks-silver-prices-chipmakers/</link><description>如果不只是一个人工智能泡沫，而是一整套泡沫怎么办？ &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-13-at-71924-PM.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 08:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/ai-bubble-sequence-saas-software-stocks-silver-prices-chipmakers/</guid></item><item><title>随着美国出生的失业率上升和工资增长停滞，特朗普将美国工人放在第一位的宏伟计划可能会适得其反</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/trump-plan-american-workers-unemployment-rising/</link><description>“这些工作通常都是非常困难、非常辛苦的工作，需要大量的体力劳动，而土生土长的工人已经很长时间没有从事这些工作了，现在没有心情接受这些工作——当然也没有这样的工资。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2289201765_d5bfa4-e1786617455880.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/trump-plan-american-workers-unemployment-rising/</guid></item><item><title>吉米·威尔士：“人工智能可以生成答案。仍然无法赢得信任”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/jimmy-wales-ai-can-generate-answers-it-still-cant-earn-trust/</link><description>维基百科的领导力课程。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/wales.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 07:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/jimmy-wales-ai-can-generate-answers-it-still-cant-earn-trust/</guid></item><item><title>微软高管谈南欧人工智能大时刻：技能而非技术将决定谁引领该地区人工智能的未来</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/southern-europe-ai-moment-skills-charles-calestroupat-microsoft/</link><description>“我认为希腊不仅仅是一个市场；我认为它是一个创新中心，”微软南欧副总裁 Charles Calestroupat 告诉《财富》希腊版。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/charles-c.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 07:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/16/southern-europe-ai-moment-skills-charles-calestroupat-microsoft/</guid></item></channel></rss>